   },
   "beats": [
    {
     "en": "First, the ore is getting poorer. Average grades have fallen 40 percent since 1991.",
     "jp": "まず、鉱石が薄くなっています。平均の品位は1991年から40%下がりました。",
     "hl": [
      "40 percent",
      "40%"
     ],
     "start": 40.626,
     "end": 46.806,
     "audio": "02_00.wav"
    },
    {
     "en": "Second, new mines have a long lead time: about 17 years.",
     "jp": "次に、新しい鉱山はリードタイムが長く、生産まで約17年かかります。",
     "hl": [
      "lead time",
      "リードタイム"
     ],
     "start": 47.456,
     "end": 51.503,
     "audio": "02_01.wav"
    },
    {
     "en": "With today's projects, the IEA sees a possible 30 percent supply gap by 2035.",
     "jp": "今の計画のままでは、2035年に30%の供給不足もありうるとIEAは見ています。",
     "hl": [
      "30 percent supply gap",
      "30%の供給不足"
     ],
     "start": 52.153,
     "end": 58.449,
     "audio": "02_02.wav"
    }
   ],
   "start": 40.026,
   "end": 59.449
