     "end": 62.56,
     "audio": "03_00.wav"
    },
    {
     "en": "Miners usually pay smelters a fee to turn ore into pure copper.",
     "jp": "鉱山会社は普通、鉱石を純粋な銅にするための手数料を製錬所に払います。",
     "hl": [
      "a fee",
      "手数料"
     ],
     "start": 63.21,
     "end": 67.203,
     "audio": "03_01.wav"
    },
    {
     "en": "In 2025, the yearly benchmark fee was about 21 dollars a tonne.",
     "jp": "2025年、その年間の基準は1トン約21ドルでした。",
     "hl": [
      "21 dollars",
      "約21ドル"
     ],
     "start": 67.853,
     "end": 72.987,
     "audio": "03_02.wav"
    },
    {
     "en": "In January 2026, it was set at zero, the lowest ever.",
     "jp": "2026年1月には、過去最低のゼロに決まりました。",
     "hl": [
      "zero",
      "ゼロ"
     ],
     "start": 73.637,
     "end": 77.856,
     "audio": "03_03.wav"
    },
    {
     "en": "Ore is so scarce that smelters are being squeezed.",
     "jp": "鉱石が足りないので、製錬所は圧迫されています。",
     "hl": [
      "squeezed",
      "圧迫されて"
     ],
     "start": 78.506,
     "end": 81.123,
     "audio": "03_04.wav"
    }
